    "detailed_description": "Is it viable to make souls-like (or rather souls-lite) shooter? Let's find out :) <br><br>BREAK PATTERN is in development by a solo developer. Inspired by soulsborne games and some old school shooters. Minimalistic design with focus on level design, puzzles, combat &amp; platforming.<br><br>You have been hired to break into a highly secure system. Your employer prudently erases your memory to be sure that if you get caught no one can trace him back. Let's hope he backed up your data.<br><br>Anyway, go from the lowest security levels up to the system core. And when you will get there you will know what to do.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/213bd265a276b8c955c859e9593d6d76.poster.avif?t=1752826101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/213bd265a276b8c955c859e9593d6d76.webm?t=1752826101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/213bd265a276b8c955c859e9593d6d76.mp4?t=1752826101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Solve a lot of puzzles.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/1683c1bfb7cf7ca9c47faaa37109634a.poster.avif?t=1752826101\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/1683c1bfb7cf7ca9c47faaa37109634a.webm?t=1752826101\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868110/extras/1683c1bfb7cf7ca9c47faaa37109634a.mp4?t=1752826101\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Survive against many threats.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinlin